1. Commands to compile/run program

    a. Fetch repository
        git submodule add 
        git submodule --init --recursive

    b. Compile program (starting within the as1 folder):
    IMPORTANT: DELETE ANY PREVIOUSLY EXISTING BUILD FOLDER
        mkdir build
        cd build
        cmake ..
        make

    c. Run program
        ./as2
    No controls

2. Readme question:
